  "note": "Disagrees with the bootstrap by design, not by error. The analytic method CONDITIONS on the argmax being correct, so it can never flag the argmax itself. The bootstrap re-estimates the argmax in every replicate and therefore also captures uncertainty about WHICH model is best - which is the dominant uncertainty in airline. The bootstrap is the faithful operationalization because the label depends on an estimated argmax; the analytic share (25%) is a lower bound."
 },
